<p>12/01/2008		2,545M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>12/01/2009		2,675M    5.20  %	  5.30</p>
<p>12/01/2010		2,810M    5.25  %	  5.40</p>
<p>12/01/2011		2,960M    5.00  %	  5.45</p>
<p>12/01/2012		3,115M    5.00  %	  5.50</p>
<p>12/01/2017	     18,165M    5.125 %	  5.63</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 93.904)</p>
<p>12/01/2029	     67,485M    5.125 %	  5.71</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 91.398)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2007    101.00</p>
